        <mxCell id="c240" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Working Capital, with the slicer saved on the cycle and the Year filter on the 3 years of the window, so the axis starts at 2024-Q4, the first quarter-end with twelve months behind it, and ends at 2026-Q4, Data Through. Outlined in teal: the days of supply, with the icons the matrix saves, against the policy targets of 28 days: an up arrow from 1.25 times the target, a down arrow at 0.8 or below, a circle between them. Only the materials of 2024-Q4 sit in that range; every other cell carries the up arrow. The tooltip page, hidden, and the page&#x27;s text box are not drawn; total rows are not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="729" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
